 item already has an overlapping booking; a booking ending the day another starts is fine.
 
-The cancellation policy (no refund less than 24 hours before the start, full refund otherwise) is not implemented yet.
+- `cancel(bookingId, at)`: cancels the booking at the instant `at` (ISO-8601 UTC string) and returns `{ bookingId, refund }`, in euro cents. A cancelled booking no longer holds its equipment, so the item can be booked and shows in `availability` again. It throws for an unknown booking, a booking already cancelled, or an invalid `at`.
+
+Cancellation policy: no refund (0) less than 24 hours before the start, full refund of the booking total otherwise (exactly 24 hours before counts as full). A cancellation after the start is refunded nothing.
 
